          "type": "text",
          "text": " Here's your slot machine! Features:\n\n**Gameplay**\n- 6 weighted symbols (🍒 most common → 💎 rarest)\n- Reels animate with staggered stop timing\n- Pays on 3-of-a-kind, with a consolation payout for 2 cherries\n- Multipliers from ×2 up to ×25 on a diamond jackpot\n\n**Controls**\n- − / + buttons to cycle bets (1, 2, 5, 10, 25 credits)\n- Spacebar or Enter also triggers a spin\n- Paytable toggle at the bottom\n\n**Quality of life**\n- Starts with 100 credits, auto-reloads if you bust\n- Win flash animation on the reel frame\n- Last win tracker in the stats bar",
